  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Definitional Mission - ENERGY &amp; POWER SECTOR IN KENYA, RWANDA AND TANZANIA, through Tusk, LLC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This $65,000 definitional mission identifies and evaluates opportunities in the energy sector in Kenya, Tanzania and Rwanda for USTDA funding consideration, with special focus on indentifying projects that fit with USTDA&apos;s current priority of prompting clean energy and combating climate change. Areas of potential cooperation include hydropower (mainly medium and small scale), biomass, biofuels, rural electrification and methane-to-energy projects.</narrative>
  </description>
